  "scenes": [
    {
      "scene": 0,
      "tone": "intro",
      "wav": "assets/channels/channel1/voice/sword/man/00.wav",
      "start": 0,
      "dur": 46.6,
      "speech_start": 3.34,
      "speech_end": 45.32,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "Welcome to Umma United.",
          "start": 3.34,
          "dur": 2.523,
          "abs_start": 3.34
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "Here is what we do on this channel.",
          "start": 5.863,
          "dur": 2.806,
          "abs_start": 5.863
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "All your life you have been handed stories about who you are and where you come from, told so often and so confidently that they begin to feel like facts set in stone.",
          "start": 8.669,
          "dur": 12.171,
          "abs_start": 8.669
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "We take those stories down, and we hold them up against the real history, the dates, the places, the record that was actually left behind.",
          "start": 20.84,
          "dur": 10.45,
          "abs_start": 20.84
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "And more often than not, they do not survive the light.",
          "start": 31.29,
          "dur": 4.7,
          "abs_start": 31.29
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "If that is the kind of thing you want more of, subscribe before we begin.",
          "start": 35.99,
          "dur": 5.23,
          "abs_start": 35.99
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "Now, let us start with the biggest story of them all.",
          "start": 41.22,
          "dur": 4.1,
          "abs_start": 41.22
        }
      ],
      "beats": [
        {
          "start": 3.34,
          "dur": 41.98,
          "label": "intro (merk)",
          "img": "",
          "vid": ""
        }
      ],
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "scene": 1,
      "tone": "hook",
      "wav": "assets/channels/channel1/voice/sword/man/01.wav",
      "start": 46.6,
      "dur": 34.15,
      "speech_start": 0.34,
      "speech_end": 32.72,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "There is one accusation thrown at Islam more than any other.",
          "start": 0.34,
          "dur": 4.585,
          "abs_start": 46.94
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "That it was never truly chosen.",
          "start": 4.925,
          "dur": 2.645,
          "abs_start": 51.525
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "That it was forced onto the world at the edge of a sword.",
          "start": 7.57,
          "dur": 4.07,
          "abs_start": 54.17
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "Convert, or die.",
          "start": 11.64,
          "dur": 1.304,
          "abs_start": 58.24
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "You hear it in classrooms, in documentaries, in half the arguments online.",
          "start": 12.944,
          "dur": 5.661,
          "abs_start": 59.544
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "So tonight we are not going to get angry, and we are not going to get defensive.",
          "start": 18.605,
          "dur": 5.764,
          "abs_start": 65.205
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "We are simply going to test it, with real history, real dates, and real places.",
          "start": 24.369,
          "dur": 5.641,
          "abs_start": 70.969
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "And then the truth can speak for itself.",
          "start": 30.01,
          "dur": 2.71,
          "abs_start": 76.61
        }
      ],
      "beats": [
        {
          "start": 0.34,
          "dur": 12.604,
          "label": "het zwaard / de beschuldiging",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/s01b1.mp4"
        },
        {
          "start": 12.944,
          "dur": 19.776,
          "label": "geschiedenis op tafel",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/s01b2.mp4"
        }
      ],
      "sfx": [
        {
          "t": 32.72,
          "name": "end",
          "file": "assets/channels/channel1/sfx/s01_end.mp3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "scene": 2,
      "tone": "nadruk",
      "wav": "assets/channels/channel1/voice/sword/man/02.wav",
      "start": 80.75,
      "dur": 51.475,
      "speech_start": 0.38,
      "speech_end": 49.92,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "Here is the test, and it is a fair one.",
          "start": 0.38,
          "dur": 3.33,
          "abs_start": 81.13
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "A faith that is only held up by force has a single weakness.",
          "start": 3.71,
          "dur": 4.56,
          "abs_start": 84.46
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "The moment that force is gone, it falls.",
          "start": 8.27,
          "dur": 3.3,
          "abs_start": 89.02
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "If people never truly believed it, they do not wait a generation to walk away.",
          "start": 11.57,
          "dur": 7.4,
          "abs_start": 92.32
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "They let go the instant no one is standing over them anymore.",
          "start": 18.97,
          "dur": 5.64,
          "abs_start": 99.72
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "So we do not need to raise our voices.",
          "start": 24.61,
          "dur": 3.152,
          "abs_start": 105.36
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "We only need to watch what force actually does to belief.",
          "start": 27.762,
          "dur": 4.608,
          "abs_start": 108.512
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "What quietly collapses the second the pressure lifts, and what refuses to break even with the full weight of an empire bearing down on it.",
          "start": 32.37,
          "dur": 10.81,
          "abs_start": 113.12
        },
        {
          "i": 8,
          "text": "We are going to see both.",
          "start": 43.18,
          "dur": 2.3,
          "abs_start": 123.93
        },
        {
          "i": 9,
          "text": "First in Rome, and then in the empires of Europe.",
          "start": 45.48,
          "dur": 4.44,
          "abs_start": 126.23
        }
      ],
      "beats": [
        {
          "start": 0.38,
          "dur": 24.23,
          "label": "de druk / de test",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/s02b1.mp4"
        },
        {
          "start": 24.61,
          "dur": 25.31,
          "label": "Rome en Europa vooruit",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/s02b2.mp4"
        }
      ],
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "scene": 3,
      "tone": "rustig",
      "wav": "assets/channels/channel1/voice/sword/man/03.wav",
      "start": 132.225,
      "dur": 53.575,
      "speech_start": 0.32,
      "speech_end": 52.46,
      "tech": "kaart",
      "view": "mena",
      "fills": {
        "rome": "red"
      },
      "labels": {
        "rome": "Roman Empire"
      },
      "kaartInfo": "Rome rules, from 380 AD",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "Start with Rome.",
          "start": 0.32,
          "dur": 1.27,
          "abs_start": 132.545
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "This was not some local kingdom.",
          "start": 1.59,
          "dur": 2.42,
          "abs_start": 133.815
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "It was the superpower of its age, ruling tens of millions of people across three continents, from the cold edge of Britain to the sands of Arabia.",
          "start": 4.01,
          "dur": 10.95,
          "abs_start": 136.235
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "And in the year 380, the emperor Theodosius signed a decree that bound that entire machine to one single religion.",
          "start": 14.96,
          "dur": 8.32,
          "abs_start": 147.185
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "From that day on, one form of Christianity was the law of the state, and every other belief was, quite literally, a crime.",
          "start": 23.28,
          "dur": 10.01,
          "abs_start": 155.505
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "Temples were pulled down.",
          "start": 33.29,
          "dur": 1.79,
          "abs_start": 165.515
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "Other Christians were hunted as heretics.",
          "start": 35.08,
          "dur": 3.31,
          "abs_start": 167.305
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "And for the next two and a half centuries, across Syria, across Egypt, and all along North Africa, you believed what the empire ordered you to believe, or you paid for it.",
          "start": 38.39,
          "dur": 14.07,
          "abs_start": 170.615
        }
      ],
      "beats": [
        {
          "start": 0.32,
          "dur": 14.64,
          "label": "kaart: Romeinse Rijk",
          "img": "",
          "vid": ""
        },
        {
          "start": 14.96,
          "dur": 18.33,
          "label": "Theodosius 380 (foto)",
          "img": "assets/channels/channel1/video/s03b2.jpg",
          "vid": ""
        },
        {
          "start": 33.29,
          "dur": 19.17,
          "label": "tempels neergehaald",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/s03b3.mp4"
        }
      ],
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "scene": 4,
      "tone": "nadruk",
      "wav": "assets/channels/channel1/voice/sword/man/04.wav",
      "start": 185.8,
      "dur": 42.475,
      "speech_start": 0.36,
      "speech_end": 40.98,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "And no one paid more dearly than the Jews.",
          "start": 0.36,
          "dur": 3.28,
          "abs_start": 186.16
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "They were taxed for their faith and shut out of public life, and in Jerusalem, their own holy city, they were forbidden from even living there at all.",
          "start": 3.64,
          "dur": 12.44,
          "abs_start": 189.44
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "Whole communities survived one new law away from losing everything.",
          "start": 16.08,
          "dur": 5.69,
          "abs_start": 201.88
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "And anyone else whose belief did not match the emperor's lived under that very same shadow.",
          "start": 21.77,
          "dur": 7.51,
          "abs_start": 207.57
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "Hold on to this picture, because it is the world that came before.",
          "start": 29.28,
          "dur": 5.244,
          "abs_start": 215.08
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "A world where the ruler alone decided what your soul was permitted to believe.",
          "start": 34.524,
          "dur": 6.456,
          "abs_start": 220.324
        }
      ],
      "beats": [
        {
          "start": 0.36,
          "dur": 15.72,
          "label": "verdreven Joden (gravure)",
          "img": "assets/channels/channel1/video/s04b1.jpg",
          "vid": ""
        },
        {
          "start": 16.08,
          "dur": 13.2,
          "label": "dezelfde schaduw (gravure)",
          "img": "",
          "vid": ""
        },
        {
          "start": 29.28,
