        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "scene": 6,
      "tone": "warm",
      "wav": "assets/channels/channel1/voice/sword/man/06.wav",
      "start": 274.775,
      "dur": 82.25,
      "speech_start": 0.34,
      "speech_end": 80.72,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "Because the Muslims forced no one.",
          "start": 0.34,
          "dur": 2.81,
          "abs_start": 275.115
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "The Christian kept his church.",
          "start": 3.15,
          "dur": 2.42,
          "abs_start": 277.925
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "The Jew kept his synagogue.",
          "start": 5.57,
          "dur": 2.38,
          "abs_start": 280.345
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "The Zoroastrian of Persia kept his fire.",
          "start": 7.95,
          "dur": 2.92,
          "abs_start": 282.725
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "Every one of them stayed free to worship exactly as he always had, his place of prayer protected, and he was not even asked to take up a weapon for the state.",
          "start": 10.87,
          "dur": 13.865,
          "abs_start": 285.645
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "Look at what Umar, may Allah be pleased with him, did the day he took Jerusalem.",
          "start": 24.735,
          "dur": 7.285,
          "abs_start": 299.51
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "He walked into a city that had banned Jews for close to five hundred years, and he lifted that ban and invited them to come home.",
          "start": 32.02,
          "dur": 10.732,
          "abs_start": 306.795
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "The conqueror arrived and undid the cruelty of the ones who came before him.",
          "start": 42.752,
          "dur": 6.922,
          "abs_start": 317.527
        },
        {
          "i": 8,
          "text": "And this was not the good manners of one unusual man.",
          "start": 49.674,
          "dur": 4.626,
          "abs_start": 324.449
        },
        {
          "i": 9,
          "text": "This was what the faith itself demanded of them.",
          "start": 54.3,
          "dur": 3.58,
          "abs_start": 329.075
        },
        {
          "i": 10,
          "text": "Because Islam is clear that no one can place belief inside another person's heart.",
          "start": 57.88,
          "dur": 6.818,
          "abs_start": 332.655
        },
        {
          "i": 11,
          "text": "Guidance comes from Allah alone.",
          "start": 64.698,
          "dur": 2.993,
          "abs_start": 339.473
        },
        {
          "i": 12,
          "text": "So the task of a believer was only ever to carry the message, to rule with justice and not with injustice, and to leave the hearts to the One who made them.",
          "start": 67.691,
          "dur": 13.029,
          "abs_start": 342.466
        }
      ],
      "beats": [
        {
          "start": 0.34,
          "dur": 5.23,
          "label": "kerk blijft open",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/s06b1.mp4"
        },
        {
          "start": 5.57,
