          "start": 24.735,
          "dur": 24.939,
          "label": "Umar in Jeruzalem",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/s06b4.mp4"
        },
        {
          "start": 49.674,
          "dur": 31.046,
          "label": "geleefde rechtvaardigheid",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/s06b5.mp4"
        }
      ],
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "scene": 7,
      "tone": "nadruk",
      "wav": "assets/channels/channel1/voice/sword/man/07.wav",
      "start": 357.025,
      "dur": 86.25,
      "speech_start": 0.34,
      "speech_end": 84.74,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "So now ask the real question, the one that takes the whole accusation apart.",
          "start": 0.34,
          "dur": 6.603,
          "abs_start": 357.365
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "If Islam was spread by forcing people to convert, the conversions would have come at once.",
          "start": 6.943,
          "dur": 6.911,
          "abs_start": 363.968
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "Convert this week, or die.",
          "start": 13.854,
          "dur": 2.446,
          "abs_start": 370.879
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "But that is the opposite of what the record shows.",
          "start": 16.3,
          "dur": 4.126,
          "abs_start": 373.325
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "For a long time after the conquests, most people in those lands stayed Christian, stayed Jewish, stayed Zoroastrian, and they were left in peace to do exactly that.",
          "start": 20.426,
          "dur": 12.114,
          "abs_start": 377.451
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "They had been handed something they never had under Rome or Persia, the simple freedom to choose.",
          "start": 32.54,
          "dur": 7.789,
          "abs_start": 389.565
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "And only after living inside that freedom did they begin, slowly, over generations, to turn to Islam on their own, until in the end it became the faith of the overwhelming majority.",
          "start": 40.329,
          "dur": 16.841,
          "abs_start": 397.354
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "That is the fingerprint of a faith that is chosen.",
          "start": 57.17,
          "dur": 4.24,
          "abs_start": 414.195
        },
        {
          "i": 8,
          "text": "The heart has to move first, and that takes time.",
          "start": 61.41,
          "dur": 4.15,
          "abs_start": 418.435
        },
        {
          "i": 9,
          "text": "Now set it beside the faith that Rome truly did force.",
          "start": 65.56,
          "dur": 4.131,
          "abs_start": 422.585
        },
        {
          "i": 10,
          "text": "The day Rome's power left those lands, that faith did not hold on for generations.",
          "start": 69.691,
          "dur": 6.779,
          "abs_start": 426.716
        },
        {
          "i": 11,
          "text": "It fell away almost at once, because for so many it had never really been theirs to begin with.",
          "start": 76.47,
          "dur": 8.27,
          "abs_start": 433.495
        }
      ],
      "beats": [
        {
          "start": 0.34,
          "dur": 20.086,
          "label": "de echte vraag",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/s07b1.mp4"
        },
        {
          "start": 20.426,
          "dur": 36.744,
          "label": "vrij, generatie na generatie",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/s07b2.mp4"
        },
        {
          "start": 57.17,
          "dur": 8.39,
          "label": "het hart beweegt eerst",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/s07b3.mp4"
        },
        {
          "start": 65.56,
          "dur": 19.18,
          "label": "Rome's geloof valt weg",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/s07b4.mp4"
        }
      ],
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "scene": 8,
      "tone": "rustig",
      "wav": "assets/channels/channel1/voice/sword/man/08.wav",
      "start": 443.275,
      "dur": 29.15,
      "speech_start": 0.36,
      "speech_end": 28,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "And what the believers built did not last for a season.",
          "start": 0.36,
          "dur": 4.22,
          "abs_start": 443.635
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "It stood for well over a thousand years.",
          "start": 4.58,
          "dur": 2.84,
          "abs_start": 447.855
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "Long enough, many times over, for a forced faith to crack and crumble into nothing.",
          "start": 7.42,
          "dur": 6.77,
          "abs_start": 450.695
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "Instead it only grew deeper, generation after generation, held up by no army at all, but by people who had come to it with open eyes and chosen it as their own.",
          "start": 14.19,
          "dur": 13.81,
          "abs_start": 457.465
        }
      ],
      "beats": [
        {
          "start": 0.36,
          "dur": 7.06,
          "label": "meer dan 1000 jaar",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/s08b1.mp4"
        },
        {
          "start": 7.42,
          "dur": 20.58,
          "label": "dieper geworteld",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/s08b2.mp4"
        }
      ],
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "scene": 9,
      "tone": "nadruk",
      "wav": "assets/channels/channel1/voice/sword/man/09.wav",
      "start": 472.425,
      "dur": 44.675,
      "speech_start": 0.36,
      "speech_end": 43.3,
      "tech": "kaart",
      "view": "belt",
      "fills": {
        "europe": "red",
        "colonised": "orange"
      },
      "labels": {
        "europe": "European empires",
        "colonised": "Muslim lands"
      },
      "kaartInfo": "Colonisation, 1500s to 1900s",
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "And then, almost a thousand years later, the test arrived again, this time from the opposite direction.",
          "start": 0.36,
          "dur": 9.032,
          "abs_start": 472.785
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "Starting in the 1500s, and rising over the next four hundred years, it was Europe's turn to sail out across the world.",
          "start": 9.392,
          "dur": 9.458,
          "abs_start": 481.817
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "The Portuguese and the Spanish, then the Dutch, the French, and the British.",
          "start": 18.85,
          "dur": 5.83,
          "abs_start": 491.275
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "They took North Africa.",
          "start": 24.68,
          "dur": 2.259,
          "abs_start": 497.105
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "They took Indonesia.",
          "start": 26.939,
          "dur": 2.098,
          "abs_start": 499.364
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "They took the Muslim lands of the Balkans.",
          "start": 29.037,
          "dur": 3.315,
          "abs_start": 501.462
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "And this time the sword was no figure of speech.",
          "start": 32.352,
          "dur": 3.619,
          "abs_start": 504.777
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "It was real, it was foreign, and a great deal of it was pointed straight at the faith itself.",
          "start": 35.971,
          "dur": 7.329,
          "abs_start": 508.396
        }
      ],
      "beats": [
        {
          "start": 0.36,
          "dur": 18.49,
          "label": "Europa vaart uit",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/s09b1.mp4"
        },
        {
          "start": 18.85,
          "dur": 13.502,
          "label": "kaart: koloniale greep",
          "img": "",
          "vid": ""
        },
        {
          "start": 32.352,
          "dur": 10.948,
          "label": "het zwaard, echt",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/s09b3.mp4"
        }
      ],
      "sfx": [
        {
          "t": 43.3,
          "name": "end",
          "file": "assets/channels/channel1/sfx/s09_end.mp3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "scene": 10,
      "tone": "nadruk",
      "wav": "assets/channels/channel1/voice/sword/man/10.wav",
      "start": 517.1,
      "dur": 55.9,
      "speech_start": 0.36,
      "speech_end": 54.34,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "And they did not come to govern gently and leave people to their prayers.",
          "start": 0.36,
          "dur": 5.51,
          "abs_start": 517.46
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "In Algeria, France turned the great mosques into cathedrals and seized the endowments that had kept the faith running for centuries.",
          "start": 5.87,
          "dur": 10.75,
          "abs_start": 522.97
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "The language of the Quran was driven out of the schools.",
          "start": 16.62,
          "dur": 4.547,
          "abs_start": 533.72
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "Rulers set community against community so that a people could never again stand as one.",
          "start": 21.167,
          "dur": 8.007,
          "abs_start": 538.267
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "Everything an empire is capable of doing to tear a faith out by its roots, they tried, with real power, for generation after generation.",
          "start": 29.174,
          "dur": 12.274,
          "abs_start": 546.274
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "So if a forced faith cannot survive, then this one, crushed for centuries under the most advanced empires on earth, should have been wiped from the map.",
          "start": 41.448,
          "dur": 12.892,
          "abs_start": 558.548
        }
      ],
      "beats": [
        {
          "start": 0.36,
          "dur": 16.26,
          "label": "moskee tot kathedraal",
          "img": "assets/channels/channel1/video/s10b1.jpg",
          "vid": ""
        },
        {
          "start": 16.62,
          "dur": 12.554,
          "label": "Quran uit de scholen",
          "img": "assets/channels/channel1/video/s10b2.jpg",
          "vid": ""
        },
        {
          "start": 29.174,
          "dur": 25.166,
          "label": "alles geprobeerd",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/s10b3.mp4"
        }
      ],
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "scene": 11,
      "tone": "warm",
      "wav": "assets/channels/channel1/voice/sword/man/11.wav",
      "start": 573,
      "dur": 46.025,
      "speech_start": 0.36,
      "speech_end": 44.48,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "It was not.",
          "start": 0.36,
          "dur": 1.1,
          "abs_start": 573.36
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "When the Europeans finally lowered their flags and sailed home after the Second World War, the faith was still standing exactly where they had first found it.",
          "start": 1.46,
          "dur": 12.647,
          "abs_start": 574.46
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "Indonesia walked out of centuries of Dutch rule and is today the largest Muslim nation on earth, with nearly nine in ten of its people Muslim.",
          "start": 14.107,
          "dur": 12.253,
          "abs_start": 587.107
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "Bosnia, surrounded in the very heart of Europe, is still Muslim and still praying.",
          "start": 26.36,
          "dur": 6.6,
          "abs_start": 599.36
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "And all along North Africa, the people who walked out into freedom carried the very same faith they had carried into occupation.",
          "start": 32.96,
          "dur": 11.52,
          "abs_start": 605.96
        }
      ],
      "beats": [
        {
          "start": 0.36,
          "dur": 13.747,
          "label": "het hield stand",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/s11b1.mp4"
        },
        {
          "start": 14.107,
          "dur": 12.253,
          "label": "Indonesie",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/s11b2.mp4"
        },
        {
          "start": 26.36,
          "dur": 6.6,
          "label": "Bosnie",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/s11b3.mp4"
        },
        {
          "start": 32.96,
          "dur": 11.52,
          "label": "Noord-Afrika",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/s11b4.mp4"
        }
      ],
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "scene": 12,
      "tone": "rustig",
      "wav": "assets/channels/channel1/voice/sword/man/12.wav",
      "start": 619.025,
      "dur": 38.8,
      "speech_start": 0.32,
      "speech_end": 37.7,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "So line it all up, and the verdict is almost embarrassing in how clear it is.",
          "start": 0.32,
          "dur": 5.812,
          "abs_start": 619.345
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "Count the believers in those lands before the colonisers ever arrived, and count them again the day they left.",
          "start": 6.132,
          "dur": 7.879,
          "abs_start": 625.157
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "The number barely moves.",
          "start": 14.011,
          "dur": 2.519,
          "abs_start": 633.036
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "The most powerful empires the world had ever built, with everything they owned aimed at one single thing, and they could not shift it an inch.",
          "start": 16.53,
          "dur": 9.74,
          "abs_start": 635.555
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "Because you cannot conquer what never lived in the soil to begin with.",
          "start": 26.27,
          "dur": 5.28,
          "abs_start": 645.295
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "It lived in the heart.",
          "start": 31.55,
          "dur": 1.526,
          "abs_start": 650.575
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "And no army in all of history has ever taken a heart.",
          "start": 33.076,
          "dur": 4.624,
          "abs_start": 652.101
        }
      ],
      "beats": [
        {
          "start": 0.32,
          "dur": 25.95,
          "label": "cijfers voor en na",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/s12b1.mp4"
        },
        {
          "start": 26.27,
          "dur": 11.43,
          "label": "geen leger neemt een hart",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/s12b2.mp4"
        }
      ],
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "scene": 13,
      "tone": "nadruk",
      "wav": "assets/channels/channel1/voice/sword/man/13.wav",
      "start": 657.825,
      "dur": 43.225,
      "speech_start": 0.34,
      "speech_end": 41.88,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "So let us return, one last time, to the rule we began with.",
          "start": 0.34,
          "dur": 4.62,
          "abs_start": 658.165
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "A faith held up by force cannot last.",
          "start": 4.96,
          "dur": 3.083,
          "abs_start": 662.785
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "The moment the force is gone, the people let it go.",
          "start": 8.043,
          "dur": 4.017,
          "abs_start": 665.868
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "It is completely true.",
          "start": 12.06,
          "dur": 1.99,
          "abs_start": 669.885
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "They had simply aimed it at the wrong religion all along.",
          "start": 14.05,
          "dur": 4.96,
          "abs_start": 671.875
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "Because there was a faith in this story that truly was forced, first by Rome and then across the whole of Europe.",
          "start": 19.01,
          "dur": 8.377,
          "abs_start": 676.835
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "Convert, or be ruined.",
          "start": 27.387,
          "dur": 2.139,
          "abs_start": 685.212
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "And if you want to see how that story ends, you do not need a history book.",
          "start": 29.526,
          "dur": 6.324,
          "abs_start": 687.351
        },
        {
          "i": 8,
          "text": "Walk through Europe today and look at its great cathedrals.",
          "start": 35.85,
          "dur": 4.061,
          "abs_start": 693.675
        },
        {
          "i": 9,
          "text": "They stand almost empty.",
          "start": 39.911,
          "dur": 1.969,
          "abs_start": 697.736
        }
      ],
      "beats": [
        {
          "start": 0.34,
          "dur": 18.67,
          "label": "de verkeerde religie",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/s13b1.mp4"
        },
        {
          "start": 19.01,
          "dur": 16.84,
          "label": "gedwongen geloof (gravure)",
          "img": "assets/channels/channel1/video/s13b2.jpg",
          "vid": ""
        },
        {
          "start": 35.85,
          "dur": 6.03,
          "label": "lege kathedralen",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/s13b3.mp4"
        }
      ],
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "scene": 14,
      "tone": "nadruk",
      "wav": "assets/channels/channel1/voice/sword/man/14.wav",
      "start": 701.05,
      "dur": 57.75,
      "speech_start": 0.36,
      "speech_end": 56.32,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "And it is worth asking, with no trace of mockery in it, why that is.",
          "start": 0.36,
          "dur": 5.99,
          "abs_start": 701.41
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "When a faith is pressed onto people by force, through generation after generation, it does not simply fade away cleanly.",
          "start": 6.35,
          "dur": 10.16,
          "abs_start": 707.4
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "It leaves a wound.",
          "start": 16.51,
          "dur": 1.758,
          "abs_start": 717.56
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "And a wounded people do not only turn away from the one faith that was forced upon them.",
          "start": 18.268,
          "dur": 6.862,
          "abs_start": 719.318
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "Given enough time, they grow wary of faith itself.",
          "start": 25.13,
          "dur": 4.581,
          "abs_start": 726.18
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "That may well be a part of what Europe is living through now, that reflex to push religion out of sight, because somewhere far back in its memory, religion first arrived as a hand closing around the throat.",
          "start": 29.711,
          "dur": 16.895,
          "abs_start": 730.761
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "Their own rule came true, in their own home, upon their own faith.",
          "start": 46.606,
          "dur": 4.797,
          "abs_start": 747.656
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "That is their history to carry, and it was never ours.",
          "start": 51.403,
          "dur": 4.917,
          "abs_start": 752.453
        }
      ],
      "beats": [
        {
          "start": 0.36,
          "dur": 17.908,
          "label": "een wond",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/s14b1.mp4"
        },
        {
          "start": 18.268,
          "dur": 28.338,
          "label": "afkeer van geloof",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/s14b2.mp4"
        },
        {
          "start": 46.606,
          "dur": 9.714,
          "label": "hun verhaal, niet het onze",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/s14b3.mp4"
        }
      ],
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "scene": 15,
      "tone": "warm",
      "wav": "assets/channels/channel1/voice/sword/man/15.wav",
      "start": 758.8,
      "dur": 44.125,
      "speech_start": 0.36,
      "speech_end": 42.62,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "Because ours was never forced upon a single soul.",
          "start": 0.36,
          "dur": 4.14,
          "abs_start": 759.16
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "Our forefathers walked into the two greatest empires on the face of the earth, and where those empires had ruled through cruelty, our forefathers ruled through justice.",
          "start": 4.5,
          "dur": 12.06,
          "abs_start": 763.3
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "They freed the hunted.",
          "start": 16.56,
          "dur": 1.872,
          "abs_start": 775.36
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "They guarded the churches, the synagogues, and the fire temples of the very people they had just defeated.",
          "start": 18.432,
          "dur": 7.688,
          "abs_start": 777.232
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "And it was that justice, and not any blade, that finally opened the hearts.",
          "start": 26.12,
          "dur": 6.21,
          "abs_start": 784.92
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "They forced their faith, and in the end they lost it.",
          "start": 32.33,
          "dur": 3.845,
          "abs_start": 791.13
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "We offered ours with an open hand, and we are the ones still holding it today.",
          "start": 36.175,
          "dur": 6.445,
          "abs_start": 794.975
        }
      ],
      "beats": [
        {
          "start": 0.36,
          "dur": 16.2,
          "label": "geregeerd met recht",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/s15b1.mp4"
        },
        {
          "start": 16.56,
          "dur": 9.56,
          "label": "beschermde gebedshuizen",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/s15b2.mp4"
        },
        {
          "start": 26.12,
          "dur": 16.5,
          "label": "recht opende de harten",
          "img": "",
          "vid": "assets/channels/channel1/video/s15b3.mp4"
        }
      ],
      "sfx": []
    },
    {
      "scene": 16,
      "tone": "warm",
      "wav": "assets/channels/channel1/voice/sword/man/16.wav",
      "start": 802.925,
      "dur": 56.525,
      "speech_start": 0.34,
      "speech_end": 55,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "So the next time someone tells you that your faith was spread by the sword, you will not need to argue, and you will not need to raise your voice.",
          "start": 0.34,
          "dur": 9.2,
          "abs_start": 803.265
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "You know the history now.",
          "start": 9.54,
          "dur": 2.503,
          "abs_start": 812.465
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "You know the dates.",
          "start": 12.043,
          "dur": 1.684,
          "abs_start": 814.968
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "You know whose hand was truly on the blade, and you know what your own forefathers did with the power they held in theirs.",
          "start": 13.727,
          "dur": 8.705,
          "abs_start": 816.652
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "They used it to establish what was right and to put an end to what was wrong.",
          "start": 22.432,
          "dur": 5.966,
          "abs_start": 825.357
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "The truth never needed a sword.",
          "start": 28.398,
          "dur": 2.54,
          "abs_start": 831.323
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "All it ever needed was to be seen clearly.",
          "start": 30.938,
          "dur": 3.512,
          "abs_start": 833.863
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "That is why, after Rome, after Persia, after every empire that ever came for it, you are still standing here today, with well over a billion others beside you.",
          "start": 34.45,
          "dur": 13.557,
          "abs_start": 837.375
        },
        {
          "i": 8,
          "text": "And every single time you rise to your feet to pray, you yourself are the living proof of it.",
          "start": 48.007,
          "dur": 6.993,
          "abs_start": 850.932
        }
      ],
      "beats": [
